----------------------------------------------------------------------------

This decoder implements the algorithms of ATSC A/52 (AC-3).  The structure
of the decoding pipeline (exponent decoding, parametric bit allocation,
coupling, rematrixing and the IMDCT decomposition) follows the well known
liba52 decoder, which is distributed under the GNU General Public License.
The implementation here was written independently from the specification;
no liba52 source code is included.  The A/52 specification and the tables
defined by it are not subject to copyright.
